WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.375
Start a new empty ChatGPT Work chat. (3× speed)

00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:00.396
Choose the workshop book from the computer. (3× speed)

00:00:00.396 --> 00:00:00.601
The workshop book is attached. (3× speed)

00:00:00.601 --> 00:00:06.201
Write the request using the attached book. (3× speed)

00:00:06.201 --> 00:00:06.972
Select the installed the learning skill skill. (3× speed)

00:00:06.972 --> 00:00:08.972
Read the complete prompt.

00:00:08.972 --> 00:00:11.133
Read the complete request and selected skill.

00:00:11.133 --> 00:00:11.447
Send the book and the skill request. (3× speed)

00:00:11.447 --> 00:00:12.006
ChatGPT prepares the skill response. (4× speed)

00:00:12.006 --> 00:00:16.221
Start with a source-based recall question.

00:00:16.221 --> 00:00:16.484
Explain training and inference from memory.

00:00:16.484 --> 00:00:26.402
Focus the Work learner answer

00:00:26.402 --> 00:00:27.113
Send the Work learner answer

00:00:27.113 --> 00:00:27.599
ChatGPT prepares source-linked feedback. (4× speed)

00:00:27.599 --> 00:00:31.897
Check the feedback against the chapter.

00:00:31.897 --> 00:00:31.977
Request a compact kit for later recall and review.

00:00:31.977 --> 00:00:41.212
Focus the Work learner answer

00:00:41.212 --> 00:00:41.726
Send the Work learner answer

00:00:41.726 --> 00:00:42.277
ChatGPT prepares source-linked feedback. (4× speed)

00:00:42.277 --> 00:00:46.836
Inspect the first study kit before requesting an interactive version.

00:00:46.836 --> 00:00:46.946
Request a reusable interactive version of the source-linked kit.

00:00:46.946 --> 00:01:09.824
Focus the Work learner answer

00:01:09.824 --> 00:01:10.481
Send the Work learner answer

00:01:10.481 --> 00:01:10.974
ChatGPT prepares source-linked feedback. (4× speed)

00:01:10.974 --> 00:01:15.991
Open the interactive kit and test its controls.

00:01:15.991 --> 00:01:18.803
Use the flashcards, written quiz and self-assessment.

00:01:18.803 --> 00:01:19.642
Remove the private source link before sharing the reusable kit.

00:01:19.642 --> 00:01:44.014
Focus the Work learner answer

00:01:44.014 --> 00:01:44.732
Send the Work learner answer

00:01:44.732 --> 00:01:45.252
ChatGPT prepares source-linked feedback. (4× speed)

00:01:45.252 --> 00:01:50.567
Verify the corrected source reference before reuse.

00:01:50.567 --> 00:01:52.453
Open the corrected interactive study kit. (3× speed)

00:01:52.453 --> 00:01:58.727
Use the original source-linked study kit.

00:01:58.727 --> 00:02:04.085
Mark the training distinction remembered.

00:02:04.085 --> 00:02:11.320
Reveal the context distinction.

00:02:11.320 --> 00:02:16.662
Keep the context distinction due for another review.

00:02:16.662 --> 00:02:23.853
Check how RAG supplies context.

00:02:23.853 --> 00:02:27.720
Mark the RAG distinction remembered.

00:02:27.720 --> 00:02:29.290
Review the card still due and recall it again.

00:02:29.290 --> 00:02:33.110
Review only the card still due.

00:02:33.110 --> 00:02:40.343
Recall the difficult distinction again.

00:02:40.343 --> 00:02:44.378
Schedule the recalled context card for later.

00:02:44.378 --> 00:03:14.936
Write, compare with the model answer and assess your explanation.

00:03:14.936 --> 00:03:21.125
Compare the three processes using the source-linked cheatsheet.

00:03:21.125 --> 00:03:35.183
Plan two five-minute retrieval-practice sessions.
